{"id":"46c4057227b126e3","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FmHRow.md","title":"FmHRow","display":"FmHRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FmHRow","parameters":["z194","z195","z196"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FmHRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z194</span><span>z195</span><span>z196</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>z194</code>、<code>z195</code>、<code>z196</code>。</p>\n<p>有限带标签公式。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FmHRow z194 z195 z196)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z196 t)\n    (or\n      (exists z199 (and (@ Nat z199) (@ PAtom z199 t)))\n      (or\n        (exists z200\n          (exists z201\n            (and\n              (@ PImp z200 z201 t)\n              (and\n                (exists z202 (exists z203 (and (in z202 z195) (and (@ App z194 z202 z203) (= z203 z200)))))\n                (exists z204 (exists z205 (and (in z204 z195) (and (@ App z194 z204 z205) (= z205 z201)))))))))\n        (or\n          (@ PBot t)\n          (or\n            (exists z206\n              (exists z207\n                (and\n                  (@ PAnd z206 z207 t)\n                  (and\n                    (exists z208 (exists z209 (and (in z208 z195) (and (@ App z194 z208 z209) (= z209 z206)))))\n                    (exists z210 (exists z211 (and (in z210 z195) (and (@ App z194 z210 z211) (= z211 z207)))))))))\n            (or\n              (exists z212\n                (exists z213\n                  (and\n                    (@ POr z212 z213 t)\n                    (and\n                      (exists z214 (exists z215 (and (in z214 z195) (and (@ App z194 z214 z215) (= z215 z212)))))\n                      (exists z216 (exists z217 (and (in z216 z195) (and (@ App z194 z216 z217) (= z217 z213)))))))))\n              (@ PTop t))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"892530c42a605aab\" href=\"?note=892530c42a605aab\" title=\"ZFC_POr\">POr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" href=\"?note=6d2e5f9b8bceac9f\" title=\"ZFC_PTop\">PTop</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FmHRow z194 z195 z196)` 按 [